{"unit_id": "tag:0758:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的一个对象（object）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>中是内射的（injective），则\n<STRUCT_0003>\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>中是内射的（injective），\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>中是内射的（injective），\n<STRUCT_0006>\n<STRUCT_0007> 若<MATH_0010>是 K-内射（injective）复形（complex），它位于<MATH_0011>中，则\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009> <MATH_0012>是 K-内射（injective）复形（complex），它位于<MATH_0013>中，\n<STRUCT_0010> <MATH_0014>是 K-内射（injective）复形（complex），它位于<MATH_0015>中，\n<STRUCT_0011>\n<STRUCT_0012>\n对于模（modules），相应陈述不成立。\n", "allowed_english": ["K"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "内射的"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "内射的"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "内射的"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "内射"}, {"source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "内射"}, {"source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "内射"}, {"source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "系数对象"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "内射的", "context": "内射对象"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "内射", "context": "K-内射性质；保留源 K- 前缀"}, {"source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形", "context": "导出范畴代表"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "反例类别"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0758:proof", "translation": "第 (1)(b) 和 (2)(b) 部分形式上由以下事实得出：限制（restriction）函子（functor）<MATH_0001>是正合（exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0002>的右伴随（right adjoint），见同调（Homology），引理<REF_0001>和导出范畴（Derived Categories），引理<REF_0002>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n第 (1)(a) 和 (2)(a) 部分有两种证明方式。第一种证明：可以利用<MATH_0003>是正合（exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0004>的右伴随（right adjoint）。这个函子（functor）在拓扑（Topologies），引理<REF_0003>中针对集合（sets）的层（sheaves）构造，在景上的模（Modules on Sites），引理<REF_0004>中针对阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）构造。景上的模（Modules on Sites），引理<REF_0005>证明它是正合的（exact）。第二种证明：可以利用<MATH_0005>，如拓扑（Topologies），引理<REF_0006>中所示。由于<MATH_0006>是一个局部化（localization），沿它的拉回（pullback）保持内射对象（injectives）和 K-内射对象（K-injectives），见景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites），引理<REF_0007>和<REF_0008>。然后对函子（functor）<MATH_0007>应用已经证明的第 (1)(b) 和 (2)(b) 部分，得到结论。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n设<MATH_0008>并考虑映射（map）<MATH_0009>。这是<MATH_0010>模（modules）在<MATH_0011>上的一个单射映射（injective map）。然而，拉回（pullback）<MATH_0012>并非单射的（injective），如在<MATH_0013>上求值可见。现在选择一个单射（injection）<MATH_0014>，将其映入一个内射的（injective）<MATH_0015>模（module）<MATH_0016>，它位于<MATH_0017>上。然后考虑图（diagram）\n<MATH_0018>\n。虚线箭头在<MATH_0019>模（modules）的范畴（category）中不能存在，因为这意味着（由伴随（adjunction））单射映射（injective map）<MATH_0020>经过非单射（noninjective）的映射（map）<MATH_0021>分解，而这是不可能的。因此<MATH_0022>不是一个内射的（injective）<MATH_0023>模（module）。\n", "allowed_english": ["K", "a", "b"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "right adjoint", "target_term": "右伴随"}, {"source_term": "Homology", "target_term": "同调"}, {"source_term": "Derived Categories", "target_term": "导出范畴"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "right adjoint", "target_term": "右伴随"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"sour